# Playwright verification (mandatory)

For **ComputerGeek Academy**, do not ship or claim a UI/feature fix without running Playwright **and reviewing screenshots**.

## Before finishing any UI / routing / content / lab change

1. Run smoke tests: `npm run test:e2e` (defaults to https://computergeekacademy.com).
2. Capture visuals: `npx playwright test e2e/visual-review.spec.js`
3. **Open and Read** the PNGs under `test-results/visual-review/` with the Read tool (images).
4. Judge contrast, brand, and layout like a human — text assertions alone are not enough.
5. Fix product issues found in screenshots before deploying.

## Product invariants

- Readable contrast (never white/light text on washed-out backgrounds)
- Python-only focus; CA$999 tuition visible
- Landing, bootcamp, `/labs/python` Code Lab work
- Visual dry-run Trace works

## Do not

- Pass only on `getByText` / URL checks
- Skip screenshot review
- Deploy with known contrast/theme failures
